          "value": "### Plan\n\n1. **Test Setup**: Create a mock environment to test the `Get-NuSpecFromManifest` function.\n2. **Test Cases**:\n   - Test if the function exists.\n   - Test if the function throws an error when mandatory parameters are missing.\n   - Test if the function correctly validates the `ManifestPath` parameter.\n   - Test if the function correctly validates the `DestinationFolder` parameter.\n   - Test if the function generates a `.nuspec` file correctly.\n   - Test if the function handles errors correctly when the `.nuspec` file cannot be created.\n\n### Code\n\n",
          "supportThemeIcons": false,
          "supportHtml": false
        },
