            "scheme": "file"
          }
        },
        {
          "value": " file is **primarily used by NuGet clients**, not by NuGet servers.\n\n### Details:\n\n- **NuGet Clients** (such as `nuget.exe`, `dotnet`, Visual Studio, etc.) use ",
          "supportThemeIcons": false,
          "supportHtml": false,
          "baseUri": {
            "$mid": 1,
            "path": "/c:/Dropbox/whertzing/GitHub/ATAP.Utilities/src/ATAP.Utilities.BuildTooling.PowerShell/",
