            "scheme": "file"
          }
        },
        {
          "value": " to determine:\n  - Which package sources to use when restoring, installing, or pushing packages.\n  - Package restore settings.\n  - Proxy settings, credentials, and other client-side behaviors.\n- **NuGet Servers** (such as a private NuGet feed or a service like MyGet or Azure Artifacts) **do not use** ",
          "supportThemeIcons": false,
          "supportHtml": false,
