      "response": [
        {
          "value": "`Publish-PSResource` is a cmdlet provided by the **PowerShellGet v3** module (not the older PowerShellGet v2). It is **not defined in your repository**; it comes from the official [PowerShellGet](https://www.powershellgallery.com/packages/PowerShellGet) module, version 3 or later.\n\n- **Module:** PowerShellGet (v3+)\n- **Docs:** [Publish-PSResource - PowerShellGet v3](https://learn.microsoft.com/powershell/gallery/psresourceget/publish-psresource)\n\nYou can check if it is available on your system with:\n```powershell\nGet-Command Publish-PSResource\n```\n\nIf not found, install or update PowerShellGet:\n```powershell\nInstall-Module PowerShellGet -Force\n```\n\n**Summary:**  \n`Publish-PSResource` is a built-in cmdlet from PowerShellGet v3+, not a function defined in your codebase.",
          "supportThemeIcons": false,
          "supportHtml": false,
          "baseUri": {
            "$mid": 1,
            "path": "/c:/Dropbox/whertzing/GitHub/ATAP.Utilities/src/ATAP.Utilities.BuildTooling.PowerShell/",
            "scheme": "file"
