          "totalElapsed": 6045
        },
        "metadata": {
          "codeBlocks": [
            {
              "code": "Get-Command Publish-PSResource\n",
              "language": "powershell",
              "markdownBeforeBlock": "`Publish-PSResource` is a cmdlet provided by the **PowerShellGet v3** module (not the older PowerShellGet v2). It is **not defined in your repository**; it comes from the official [PowerShellGet](https://www.powershellgallery.com/packages/PowerShellGet) module, version 3 or later.\n\n- **Module:** PowerShellGet (v3+)\n- **Docs:** [Publish-PSResource - PowerShellGet v3](https://learn.microsoft.com/powershell/gallery/psresourceget/publish-psresource)\n\nYou can check if it is available on your system with:\n"
            },
            {
              "code": "Install-Module PowerShellGet -Force\n",
              "language": "powershell",
              "markdownBeforeBlock": "\nIf not found, install or update PowerShellGet:\n"
            }
          ],
          "toolCallRounds": [
            {
              "response": "`Publish-PSResource` is a cmdlet provided by the **PowerShellGet v3** module (not the older PowerShellGet v2). It is **not defined in your repository**; it comes from the official [PowerShellGet](https://www.powershellgallery.com/packages/PowerShellGet) module, version 3 or later.\n\n- **Module:** PowerShellGet (v3+)\n- **Docs:** [Publish-PSResource - PowerShellGet v3](https://learn.microsoft.com/powershell/gallery/psresourceget/publish-psresource)\n\nYou can check if it is available on your system with:\n```powershell\nGet-Command Publish-PSResource\n```\n\nIf not found, install or update PowerShellGet:\n```powershell\nInstall-Module PowerShellGet -Force\n```\n\n**Summary:**  \n`Publish-PSResource` is a built-in cmdlet from PowerShellGet v3+, not a function defined in your codebase.",
